OL,3,AWhen will #100 energy support be paid?
OL,4,AWill I pay more tax on savings? We
OL,5,Aanswer your Budget questions
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe UK faces the "worst decade for
OL,8,Fhousehold income growth on record",
OL,9,Faccording to the head of the
OL,10,Finfluential Institute for Fiscal
OL,11,FStudies (IFS) think tank
OL,13,FIt comes after the head of government
OL,14,Fspending watchdog the Office for Budget
OL,15,FResponsibility (OBR) warned the
OL,16,Fcountry's economic outlook is a "pretty
OL,17,Fgrim picture"
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
